nctors）<MATH_0009>，满足<MATH_0010>（由于每个态射（morphism）都是强笛卡尔（strongly cartesian）的，<MATH_0011>自动保持它们）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 其<MATH_0012>-态射（morphisms）<MATH_0013>，对于<MATH_0014>，是函子（functors）的态射（morphisms），满足<MATH_0015>，对所有<MATH_0016>均如此。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:33d3945b711c06df9040bf20b2a134716921531f2e3e9acc710eef7f74525550", "unit_id": "tag:02Y1:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "基底及高阶范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "本定义的高阶范畴名称，阶数及基底受保护；待决。", "source_term": "category of categories fibred in setoids", "target_term": "集合胚纤维化范畴之范畴"}, {"context": "高阶范畴的对象；待决。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "给定范畴的纤维化条件；待决。", "source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"context": "环境范畴的群胚纤维化条件；待决。", "source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "对象的集合胚纤维化条件；待决。", "source_term": "setoids", "target_term": "集合胚"}, {"context": "高阶范畴中的对象；待决。", "source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "带阶数限定的态射及函子之间的态射；待决。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "第一阶态射及第二阶态射的端点；待决。", "source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "自动具有强笛卡尔性的态射；待决。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "所有态射自动具有的性质；待决。", "source_term": "strongly cartesian", "target_term": "强笛卡尔"}]}
